Lexbor 3.0.0 for THE WRLD OS (XplorerLite's HTML5 parser and CSS selector parser)

Source: Ubuntu's copy of the upstream release archive
  http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/universe/l/lexbor/lexbor_3.0.0.orig.tar.gz
  SHA-256 6c10e42eff581a7996ac91764a394f2375f1dae8a583634169343725e29fa770
  (matches lexbor_3.0.0-1.dsc)

Included, unmodified: source/lexbor/{core,dom,html,tag,ns,css} and the POSIX
port's core/memory.c (malloc/realloc/calloc/free come from the C library shim
in third_party/quickjs-shim). Left out: encoding, unicode, url, punycode,
selectors (XplorerLite matches selectors on its own tree, src/lexbor/lexglue.c),
style, engine, tests, examples, benchmarks.

